WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Make it yours: preferences, Info Chat and generation.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:10.000
Review the current price. Pay through an available method. No
subscription.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.200
Set your pace and priorities. Culture, food, breaks and any
important requirements.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.200
Get help while you personalize. The assistant knows the cities
included in your route.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:29.200
Example conversation: Must-see places by city. Ask about Madrid,
Barcelona and their day trips together.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:36.400
Example conversation: all six destinations are included in the trip
context.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:42.200
Add lodging and must-see places. ITBMO keeps your known details and
fills in the rest.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:48.000
Personalize each city. Lodging, transport and places you cannot
miss.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.800
Choose your itinerary language. Your itinerary language can differ
from the interface.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:58.000
Everything is ready. Click Create itinerary when you are ready.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.800
Generation explainer: keep the tab open while ITBMO creates your
itinerary.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.583
After generation, explore your results.

